    <h1>Privacy Notice</h1>

    <div class="notice-box">
      <p><strong>Draft for review.</strong> This page is a working draft prepared for internal and legal review. It does not yet constitute a final, owner-approved statement of Foreign Immigration Services' privacy practices and must not be relied upon as authoritative until reviewed and approved.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>Scope</h2>
    <p>This notice concerns personal data collected through this website, including where a visitor contacts Foreign Immigration Services by email.</p>

    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>If you email us, we receive the information you choose to include, which may typically consist of your name, contact details, and the details of your enquiry.</p>

    <h2>How We Use Information</h2>
    <p>Information sent to us is used to respond to your enquiry and, where you become a client, to provide the services requested.</p>

    <h2>Philippine Data Privacy Act 2012</h2>
    <p>Foreign Immigration Services intends to handle personal data in accordance with the Philippine Data Privacy Act of 2012 and its implementing rules. Further details regarding our Data Protection Officer, applicable registration with the National Privacy Commission, and data retention periods will be published here once determined.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this notice may be sent to <a href="mailto:info@foreignimmigration.ph">info@foreignimmigration.ph</a>.</p>
  </div>
